#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about the management responsibilities that you have when you use IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Pelajari tentang tanggung jawab manajemen yang kamu miliki saat menggunakan IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding your responsibilities when using IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Memahami tanggung jawabmu saat menggunakan IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Understanding your responsibilities when using IBM Quantum Compute Service {#understanding-your-responsibilities-when-using-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Memahami tanggung jawabmu saat menggunakan IBM Quantum Compute Service {#understanding-your-responsibilities-when-using-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review the following sections for the specific responsibilities for you and for IBM&reg; when you use IBM Quantum Compute Service. For the overall terms of use, see [Terms and Notices](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview/terms-of-use?topic=overview-terms) for IBM Cloud&reg;.\n"
msgstr "Tinjau bagian-bagian berikut untuk tanggung jawab spesifik kamu dan IBM&reg; saat menggunakan IBM Quantum Compute Service. Untuk syarat penggunaan secara keseluruhan, lihat [Syarat dan Ketentuan](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview/terms-of-use?topic=overview-terms) untuk IBM Cloud&reg;.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Incident and operations management {#incident-and-operations-management}"
msgstr "Manajemen insiden dan operasi {#incident-and-operations-management}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Incident and operations management includes tasks such as monitoring, event management, high availability, problem determination, recovery, and full-state backup and recovery.\n"
msgstr "Manajemen insiden dan operasi mencakup tugas-tugas seperti pemantauan, manajemen event, ketersediaan tinggi, penentuan masalah, pemulihan, serta pencadangan dan pemulihan status penuh.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Infrastructure health management|<ul><li>Continuously deliver new features, updates, and bug fixes as needed in a transparent manner.</li><li>Provide notifications for planned maintenance, security bulletins, or unplanned outages.</li></ul> | <ul><li>[Set preferences to receive emails](https://cloud.ibm.com/user/notifications) about service notifications.</li><li>Monitor the [IBM Cloud status](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) page for general announcements.</li></ul> |\n"
"|Infrastructure health monitoring and notification| <ul><li>Remediate all infrastructure environment issues.</li><li> Notify customers of applicable incidents.</li></ul> | <ul><li> Ascertain the impact of each reported incident.</li><li>Engage [IBM Support](/guides/support) as required.</li></ul>|\n"
"|Maintain IBM Cloud high availability SLA| Operate IBM Quantum Compute Service in accordance with the [IBM Cloud Public Service Level Agreements](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-slas) (SLAs). | Follow high availability best practices. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tugas | Tanggung jawab IBM | Tanggung jawabmu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Manajemen kesehatan infrastruktur|<ul><li>Terus menghadirkan fitur baru, pembaruan, dan perbaikan bug sesuai kebutuhan secara transparan.</li><li>Memberikan notifikasi untuk pemeliharaan terjadwal, buletin keamanan, atau pemadaman yang tidak direncanakan.</li></ul> | <ul><li>[Atur preferensi untuk menerima email](https://cloud.ibm.com/user/notifications) tentang notifikasi layanan.</li><li>Pantau halaman [status IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) untuk pengumuman umum.</li></ul> |\n"
"|Pemantauan dan notifikasi kesehatan infrastruktur| <ul><li>Memperbaiki semua masalah lingkungan infrastruktur.</li><li>Memberitahu pelanggan tentang insiden yang relevan.</li></ul> | <ul><li>Menentukan dampak dari setiap insiden yang dilaporkan.</li><li>Menghubungi [IBM Support](/guides/support) sesuai kebutuhan.</li></ul>|\n"
"|Mempertahankan SLA ketersediaan tinggi IBM Cloud| Mengoperasikan IBM Quantum Compute Service sesuai dengan [Perjanjian Tingkat Layanan Publik IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-slas) (SLA). | Ikuti praktik terbaik ketersediaan tinggi. |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change management {#change-management}"
msgstr "Manajemen perubahan {#change-management}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change management includes tasks such as deployment, configuration, upgrades, patching, configuration changes, and deletion.\n"
msgstr "Manajemen perubahan mencakup tugas-tugas seperti deployment, konfigurasi, upgrade, patching, perubahan konfigurasi, dan penghapusan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Major version upgrades | Provide availability and tools for major version updates. | Migrate to a supported version before end-of-support for an old version. |\n"
"| API version changes | Versioning the REST APIs. | Integrate with the wanted version of REST APIs. |\n"
"| Updates, fixes, and new features | <ul><li>Provide regular updates, bug fixes, and new features, transparently following a continuous delivery model.</li><li>Post notifications for changes that impact customers.</li></ul> | <ul><li>Set preferences to [receive email notifications](https://cloud.ibm.com/user/notifications) and monitor the [IBM Cloud status](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) page for general announcements.</li><li>Read system-generated notifications and [platform announcements](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/notifications), and take appropriate action.</li></ul> |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tugas | Tanggung jawab IBM | Tanggung jawabmu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Upgrade versi mayor | Menyediakan ketersediaan dan alat untuk pembaruan versi mayor. | Migrasi ke versi yang didukung sebelum akhir dukungan untuk versi lama. |\n"
"| Perubahan versi API | Melakukan versioning pada REST API. | Integrasikan dengan versi REST API yang diinginkan. |\n"
"| Pembaruan, perbaikan, dan fitur baru | <ul><li>Menyediakan pembaruan rutin, perbaikan bug, dan fitur baru secara transparan mengikuti model pengiriman berkelanjutan.</li><li>Memposting notifikasi untuk perubahan yang berdampak pada pelanggan.</li></ul> | <ul><li>Atur preferensi untuk [menerima notifikasi email](https://cloud.ibm.com/user/notifications) dan pantau halaman [status IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) untuk pengumuman umum.</li><li>Baca notifikasi yang dihasilkan sistem dan [pengumuman platform,](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/notifications) lalu ambil tindakan yang sesuai.</li></ul> |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identity and access management {#identity-and-access-management}"
msgstr "Manajemen identitas dan akses {#identity-and-access-management}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Identity and access management includes tasks such as authentication, authorization, managing access control policies, and approving, granting, and revoking access.\n"
msgstr "Manajemen identitas dan akses mencakup tugas-tugas seperti autentikasi, otorisasi, pengelolaan kebijakan kontrol akses, serta persetujuan, pemberian, dan pencabutan akses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Identity and access control | Provide the ability to manage and restrict access to resources through IBM Cloud. | Grant, revoke, and manage access to resources through [Cloud Identity and Access Management](/guides/access-groups) (IAM). |\n"
"| Service authentication | Ensure that only authenticated users have access to your IBM Quantum Compute Service and resources. | <ul><li>[Safeguard your API key](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment) from unauthorized access.</li><li>Rotate and update your [API keys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys) according to your security policy requirements.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Observability | Allow integration of IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing to audit user actions. | Set up [IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vmware-service?topic=vmware-service-at_events) or other functions to track user activity. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tugas | Tanggung jawab IBM | Tanggung jawabmu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Kontrol identitas dan akses | Menyediakan kemampuan untuk mengelola dan membatasi akses ke sumber daya melalui IBM Cloud. | Berikan, cabut, dan kelola akses ke sumber daya melalui [Cloud Identity and Access Management](/guides/access-groups) (IAM). |\n"
"| Autentikasi layanan | Memastikan bahwa hanya pengguna yang terautentikasi yang dapat mengakses layanan dan sumber daya IBM Quantum Compute Service kamu. | <ul><li>[Jaga API key-mu](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#initialize-the-service-in-an-untrusted-environment) dari akses yang tidak sah.</li><li>Rotasi dan perbarui [API key](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys)-mu sesuai persyaratan kebijakan keamananmu.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Observabilitas | Mengizinkan integrasi IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing untuk mengaudit tindakan pengguna. | Siapkan [IBM Cloud Activity Tracker Event Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vmware-service?topic=vmware-service-at_events) atau fungsi lainnya untuk melacak aktivitas pengguna. |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security and regulation compliance {#security-and-regulation-compliance}"
msgstr "Keamanan dan kepatuhan regulasi {#security-and-regulation-compliance}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security and regulation compliance includes tasks such as security controls implementation and compliance certification.\n"
msgstr "Keamanan dan kepatuhan regulasi mencakup tugas-tugas seperti implementasi kontrol keamanan dan sertifikasi kepatuhan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| General | <ul><li>Maintain controls commensurate to various industry compliance standards.</li><li>Monitor, isolate, and recover service functionality.</li><li>Monitor and report the health of service interfaces.</li></ul> | Ensure that personal and regulated data is not provided. |\n"
"| Vulnerabilities | Monitor to detect vulnerability and security compliance issues. | <ul><li>Keep informed about possible vulnerabilities and security issues through security bulletins that provide potential remediation actions.</li><li>Check the [security section of the Qiskit GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/security). All security vulnerabilities are posted there.</li><li>Check the [IBM Cloud status website](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) to find announcements and security bulletins about key events that affect the IBM Cloud platform, infrastructure, and major services.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Encryption | Encrypt data when it is transmitted on any public networks and within the Cloud Service's private data center network. Encryption methods such as HTTPS and TLS are used to protect data in motion. | Ensure, as required, that your connection is encrypted end-to-end. |\n"
"| Security | <ul><li>Ensure the security of data on disk and data in motion within its infrastructure.</li><li>Provide a secure service that complies with key standards.</li></ul> | Restrict [user access](/guides/access-groups) to the appropriate resources and resource groups. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tugas | Tanggung jawab IBM | Tanggung jawabmu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Umum | <ul><li>Mempertahankan kontrol yang sepadan dengan berbagai standar kepatuhan industri.</li><li>Memantau, mengisolasi, dan memulihkan fungsionalitas layanan.</li><li>Memantau dan melaporkan kesehatan antarmuka layanan.</li></ul> | Pastikan bahwa data pribadi dan data yang diatur tidak diberikan. |\n"
"| Kerentanan | Memantau untuk mendeteksi masalah kerentanan dan kepatuhan keamanan. | <ul><li>Tetap terinformasi tentang kemungkinan kerentanan dan masalah keamanan melalui buletin keamanan yang memberikan tindakan perbaikan potensial.</li><li>Periksa [bagian keamanan repositori GitHub Qiskit.](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/security) Semua kerentanan keamanan diposting di sana.</li><li>Periksa [situs web status IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/status) untuk menemukan pengumuman dan buletin keamanan tentang peristiwa penting yang memengaruhi platform IBM Cloud, infrastruktur, dan layanan utama.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Enkripsi | Mengenkripsi data saat ditransmisikan di jaringan publik mana pun dan di dalam jaringan pusat data privat Cloud Service. Metode enkripsi seperti HTTPS dan TLS digunakan untuk melindungi data dalam perjalanan. | Pastikan, sesuai kebutuhan, bahwa koneksimu dienkripsi dari ujung ke ujung. |\n"
"| Keamanan | <ul><li>Memastikan keamanan data di disk dan data dalam perjalanan di dalam infrastrukturnya.</li><li>Menyediakan layanan yang aman yang mematuhi standar-standar utama.</li></ul> | Batasi [akses pengguna](/guides/access-groups) ke sumber daya dan grup sumber daya yang sesuai. |\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disaster recovery {#disaster-recovery}"
msgstr "Pemulihan bencana {#disaster-recovery}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task | IBM responsibilities | Your responsibilities |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| General | Restore or rebuild the provisioning environments and resources in the affected regions. | <ul><li>Monitor instance and resource states.</li><li>Provision new IBM Quantum Compute Service [instances](/guides/instances) in an alternate region, if available.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Recovery of services | Automatically recover and restore IBM Quantum Compute Service capabilities to normal operations. | Resubmit any impacted jobs following recovery. |\n"
"| Backup of user configuration data | IBM is not responsible for backup of user configuration data. | Backup of any configuration data, as needed. |\n"
"| Backup and recovery of workloads | IBM is not responsible for backup or recovery of user workload data. | Backup and recovery of your workloads, as needed. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Tugas | Tanggung jawab IBM | Tanggung jawabmu |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| Umum | Memulihkan atau membangun kembali lingkungan provisi dan sumber daya di wilayah yang terdampak. | <ul><li>Pantau status instance dan sumber daya.</li><li>Provision instance IBM Quantum Compute Service baru di [wilayah](/guides/instances) alternatif, jika tersedia.</li></ul> |\n"
"| Pemulihan layanan | Secara otomatis memulihkan dan mengembalikan kemampuan IBM Quantum Compute Service ke operasi normal. | Kirim ulang job yang terdampak setelah pemulihan. |\n"
"| Pencadangan data konfigurasi pengguna | IBM tidak bertanggung jawab atas pencadangan data konfigurasi pengguna. | Pencadangan data konfigurasi apa pun, sesuai kebutuhan. |\n"
"| Pencadangan dan pemulihan workload | IBM tidak bertanggung jawab atas pencadangan atau pemulihan data workload pengguna. | Pencadangan dan pemulihan workload-mu, sesuai kebutuhan. |\n"
